This repository is a mixed-license work. The following project-authored Java
loader sources, and the bytecode compiled directly from them, are offered at
the recipient's choice under either the MIT License or the GNU Lesser General
Public License version 2.1 or later (`MIT OR LGPL-2.1-or-later`):

- `runtime-shared/src/main/java/**`
- `runtime-ffmpeg-shared/src/main/java/**`
- `ass-runtime-desktop/src/main/java/**`
- `runtime-desktop/src/main/java/**`
- `ass-runtime-android/src/main/java/**`
- `runtime-android/src/main/java/**`

The additional MIT offer covers the corresponding project-authored loader
source and bytecode first conveyed in KMediaFfmpegRuntime 0.1.0-rc.7 and later.
It permits a distributor to compile those loader classes into a proprietary
GraalVM Native Image without imposing LGPL relinking requirements on the
independent application. Permissions already conveyed under the LGPL remain
available and are not withdrawn.

Project-authored native probes, native build material, patches, compliance and
release tooling, replacement/relinking material, and all other project-authored
files marked `LGPL-2.1-or-later` remain licensed only under the GNU Lesser
General Public License version 2.1 or later. The complete texts are in:

- `LICENSES/MIT.txt`
- `LICENSES/LGPL-2.1.txt`

The Gradle wrapper retains its Apache-2.0 license. Third-party components retain
their own licenses; see `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md` and the release SBOM. This map
does not relicense FFmpeg, FriBidi, libass, FreeType, HarfBuzz, OpenSSL, or any
other third-party work.

An SPDX identifier in a source file is authoritative for that file. Versions
released before 0.1.0-rc.7 remain available solely under the terms conveyed
with those versions.
